/*
  VehicleSettingsTab.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0308 · VehicleSettingsTab (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleSettingsTab` resolves (table "VehicleSettingsTab") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/VehicleSettingsTab.tsx + its i18n catalog
  web/src/i18n/en.json `vehicleSettings.*`), preserved verbatim. The second group
  backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error copy and the
  native date control affordances), so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

